b12x
  High-performance kernels for NVIDIA Blackwell (SM12x), used here through the
  spark-vllm-b12x image (`--load-format b12x`, `--moe-backend b12x`,
  `--linear-backend b12x`, `--gdn-decode-kernel b12x`).
  https://github.com/eugr/spark-vllm-docker

FlashInfer
  https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer
  Apache License, Version 2.0.
  docker/ple_queue_depth.py modifies flashinfer/experimental/b12x/sequence/ple_embedding/_disk.py from
  flashinfer-python 0.7.1, as shipped in the eugr/spark-vllm-b12x base image, while building the recipe image.
  The only change makes DiskTable's default io_uring queue depth read PLE_QUEUE_DEPTH (256 when unset)
  instead of the fixed 64.

