Layout
  The launcher layout (start.sh, stop.sh, scripts/config.sh, scripts/prepare.sh, a config
  table, and a LIVE line after a smoke test) follows MiaAI-Lab's single-Spark TensorFold
  recipe as a layout only:
  https://github.com/MiaAI-Lab/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-Single-DGX-Spark-TensorFold
  This repository does not include TensorFold, its engine, or its measurements.

